        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-1213, Rope Cabinet Knob with Detailed Back Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA true classic, the rope cabinet knob is the perfect finishing touch for traditionally styled homes. This knob is available in both a 1-1/4 inch diameter and a 1-1/2 inch diameter in order to fit a number of applications. The Rope Cabinet Knob with Matching Rose, can be used on kitchen cabinets, bathroom drawers, accordion closets, and even furniture. It features an easy screw-on installation and is available in 9 beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-1213 Rope Cabinet Knob with Matching Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-1213:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-1212:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
